//
// Source-of-truth: docs/architecture/adrs/adr-164-chora-payments-service.md
//   + .claude/rules/ddd-enforcement.md
//   + chora-contracts/proto/events/payments/*.proto (8 source aggregate protos)
//
// Inter-service gRPC contract for the Chora Payments supporting domain
// (chora_payments database, Team 3 / Platform). Owns the Stripe SDK +
// 8 Purchase aggregates (course_purchase, application_payment,
// companion_egg_purchase, tenant_mana_topup, user_mana_topup,
// user_subscription, identity_kyc_fee, tenant_addon_purchase).
//
// Originating services (chora-delivery, chora-tenancy, chora-identity)
// call this service synchronously to mint Stripe Checkout Sessions on
// behalf of learners / tenants / admins. The webhook receive path is
// HTTP-only (Stripe → chora-gateway → chora-payments) and is NOT
// modelled here.
//
// Cross-DB queries FORBIDDEN — soft FKs (course_id, application_id, ...)
// are UUIDs without referential constraints; the originating service
// validates existence before invoking the matching Create*Session RPC.
//
// Deployed in chora-payments (Team 3 / Platform). mTLS via Cloud Service
// Mesh; SPIFFE identity in mesh; W3C trace context in gRPC metadata.
//
// Per ADR-164 PROPOSED 2026-05-24 — Stripe-correlation extract from
// chora-delivery / chora-tenancy / chora-identity.
